// OWN-19: a generic T cannot be a scoped View type, even for a copying argument.
// A take parameter does not unwrap the view as an unmarked parameter does (OWN-7).
// expect: refuse OWN-19 at 6:25
// Generic bodies are checked once and materialized.
fn eat[T](take t: T) {}
fn f(v: View[u8]) { eat(v) }
